I believe I have figured out a reliable way to wield a cockatrice corpse
without gloves. (Note that this is not in any way useful during a real
game, as you would have the gloves long before the equipment you needed
to do this, unless you were playing a nudist or something.) Simply perform
the following steps:

1. Wear an amulet of lifesaving.
2. Poly into a stone golem.
3. Wield a cockatrice corpse.
4. Poly back into whatever you used to be.
5. Being no longer petrify-resistant, you turn to stone... but wait!
   Your medallion begins to glow!

You should be your original form, wielding a cockatrice corpse, without
gloves. 

I've tried this in wizard mode and explore mode. Can anyone prove
me wrong?  Is this likely to be a bug?

